Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

English Brain builds on, or interoperates with, the following open-source
projects. Each is the property of its respective authors and is distributed
under its own license. They are NOT bundled in this repository unless noted;
they are fetched or run as separate services.

Client (Flutter / Dart)
  - Flutter & Dart SDK ............ BSD-3-Clause .......... https://flutter.dev
  - Riverpod ...................... MIT .................. https://riverpod.dev
  - go_router, drift, just_audio,
    record, flutter_tts, fl_chart,
    google_fonts, shared_preferences,
    path_provider, connectivity_plus,
    dio (+ smart_retry), intl ...... MIT / BSD (per package) ... https://pub.dev
  - shorebird_code_push ........... MIT .................. https://shorebird.dev

Backend (Python)
  - FastAPI ....................... MIT .................. https://fastapi.tiangolo.com
  - Uvicorn ....................... BSD-3-Clause ......... https://www.uvicorn.org
  - py-fsrs ....................... MIT .................. https://github.com/open-spaced-repetition/py-fsrs
  - httpx ......................... BSD-3-Clause ......... https://www.python-httpx.org

AI services (run as separate containers/processes)
  - Ollama ........................ MIT .................. https://ollama.com
  - Speaches (Faster-Whisper) ..... MIT / MIT ............ https://github.com/speaches-ai/speaches
  - Kokoro-82M (TTS) .............. Apache-2.0 ........... https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  - wav2vec2 (via transformers) ... Apache-2.0 / MIT ..... https://github.com/huggingface/transformers
  - Montreal Forced Aligner ....... MIT .................. https://montreal-forced-aligner.readthedocs.io

Infrastructure
  - Docker / Docker Compose ....... Apache-2.0 ........... https://www.docker.com
  - Caddy ......................... Apache-2.0 ........... https://caddyserver.com

For the exact license text of each dependency, refer to that project's
repository. Version pins live in `app/pubspec.yaml`, `backend/requirements.txt`
and `nas/docker-compose.yml`.
